    "text": {
     "en": "Materials have properties. Some are hard, like stone and iron. Some are soft, like cotton and sponge.\nSome surfaces are rough, like a brick, and some are smooth, like glass.\nSome are transparent, so we can see through them, like glass, and some are not.\nWe choose materials by their properties. A pillow is soft, a hammer is hard."
